Electron adaptation notes (42-x-y): M148's
RenderFrameHostImpl::ValidateURLAndOrigin still derives `is_pdf` from the
NavigationRequest instead of the later EmbedderIsolationInfo plumbing, so
that pre-existing block is kept as-is; only the `is_sandboxed` fallback
and the synchronous about:blank origin check are taken from upstream.

